<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New Demo User Signup Request</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>New Demo User Signup Request</h2>
  <p>A new user has sign up for a demo account.</p>
  <h3>User Details:</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Name:</strong> <%= user.fullName %></li>
    <% if(user.email) { %>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <%= user.email %></li>
    <% } %>

    <% if(user.mobile) { %>
      <li><strong>Mobile Number:</strong> <%= user.mobile %></li>
    <% } %>

    <li><strong>Country:</strong> <%= user.country || 'Unknown' %></li>
    
    <% if(message) { %>
      <li><strong>Message:</strong> <%= message %></li>
    <% } %>
  </ul>
  <h3>Instructions to Activate User Account:</h3>
  <p>
    Please follow up with the instruction to activate the demo user account and provide the demo and provide any additional information they may need.
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Log in to the Dimitra platform with credentials for email: admin@dimitra.io</li>
    <li>Go to User Management > Users</li>
    <li>Search for the user by their email or phone number using the search field</li>
    <li>Click on Activate Icon</li>
    <li>Confirm account activation</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Best regards,<br/>The Dimitra Team</p>
</body>
</html>